      Attack Box","body":"This is how Velora deals damage. If the player enters the
      box, it gets the current attack and deals the appropriate amount of damage
      using the Hurt event.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"498b02db-8244-4624-8ab2-601d06b4f917","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-282.0,"yMin":418.0,"xMax":-56.0,"yMax":539.0},"title":"Velora
      Attack Box","body":"Velora has 2 attack boxes, one for her spikes and one for
      her whip. When a box is told to animate, it turns on its sprite and animator,
      waits for the length of the clip, and turns them back off.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"8f553e0e-bb8e-4353-970f-9ed10d03a46a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
